---
import ServicePage from '../../components/ServicePage.astro';
---
<ServicePage
  serviceKey="industrial-warehouse"
  seoTitle="Industrial and Warehouse Properties in Ahmedabad"
  seoDescription="Lease or buy warehouses, sheds, cold storage and industrial land across Ahmedabad’s logistics belts with City Property Services, from search to handover."
  eyebrow="Industrial and warehouse"
  heading="Industrial and Warehouse Properties"
  intro="Your warehouse or factory should make daily operations easier, not harder. We help you find industrial and storage space that supports smooth movement, safe storage, dependable utilities and room to grow."
  lead={[
    "Storage and supply chain needs vary a lot. A cold storage unit, a third party logistics hub and a manufacturing shed each ask for different ceiling heights, power loads, truck access and locations.",
    "We work across Ahmedabad’s established industrial and logistics belts, including areas like Changodar, Bavla, Sanand, Sanathal, Aslali, Narol, Vatva, Odhav and Naroda, so we can match your operations to the right address and the right approach roads.",
  ]}
  helpItems={[
    "Warehouses, godowns and storage units of many sizes",
    "Cold storage and food and beverage storage facilities",
    "Third party logistics hubs, dark stores and distributor centres",
    "Industrial sheds for manufacturing and assembly",
    "Industrial land for building to your own requirement",
    "Highway connected locations with easy truck movement",
  ]}
  idealFor={["Manufacturers", "Logistics and 3PL", "Ecommerce fulfilment", "Distributors", "Cold chain businesses", "Supply chain teams"]}
  support={[
    { title: "Understand your operations", text: "We learn how goods move in and out, what you store, and the power, height and access you need." },
    { title: "Shortlist suitable belts", text: "We point you to industrial pockets that fit your process, your labour pool and your transport routes." },
    { title: "Check the essentials", text: "Approach roads, truck turning, floor strength, power load, water and safety all get verified." },
    { title: "Plan for growth", text: "We keep your future expansion in mind so the space serves you for years, not months." },
    { title: "Close the deal", text: "We support negotiation, documentation and handover from start to finish." },
  ]}
  ctaLabel="Find Industrial or Warehouse Space"
  formIntent="Industrial & Warehouse"
  sizeHint="e.g. 10,000 sqft shed, or 2 acres of industrial land"
  relatedCategory="industrial"
  landingTypes={["warehouse", "industrial-shed", "land"]}
  extraTypes={["industrial land"]}
  faq={[
    { q: 'What does warehouse space cost to lease around Ahmedabad?', a: 'Our {rentCount} current warehouse and industrial listings carry asking rents from {rentRange}, quoted per sq.ft per month. Rates vary with the belt (Aslali, Changodar, Sanand, Bavla, Kheda), the road frontage, floor quality, height and dock access.' },
    { q: 'Which industrial belts do you cover?', a: 'Listings are currently spread across {localityCount} localities including {topLocalities}, along the Ahmedabad–Rajkot, Ahmedabad–Mumbai and Kheda highways and the SP Ring Road. Each belt page below lists every current warehouse with size and rent.' },
    { q: 'What warehouse sizes are available?', a: 'Current listings range from {sizeRange}. We handle single sheds for small operators through to 2 to 3 lakh sq.ft built-to-suit and multi-tenant parks for logistics companies.' },
    { q: 'What should I check before leasing a warehouse?', a: 'Clear height, floor load capacity, dock and ramp access, road width for container movement, power sanction, fire NOC, N.A. and zoning status, and whether the plot has clean title. We verify these before you visit, not after.' },
    { q: 'Can you find industrial land for a factory?', a: 'Yes. We source N.A. industrial and GIDC-adjacent land across the Sanand, Changodar, Bavla and Kheda belts, and check title, zoning, access and utilities before you commit.' },
    { q: 'Do you handle warehouse sale as well as lease?', a: 'Mostly lease, because that is what the market prefers, but {saleCount} of our industrial listings are for sale. We also advise investors on pre-leased warehouses with operating tenants.' },
  ]}
/>
